WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:21.158
Mr. Grill's plow was broken.

2
00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:24.889
"Oh no," said Eddy.

3
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:31.095
"This is bad," said Mr. Grill.

4
00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:35.067
The snow got deeper.

5
00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:42.752
The snow piles got bigger.

6
00:00:42.753 --> 00:00:47.044
"How will we drive home?" said Poppy.

7
00:00:47.045 --> 00:00:53.242
Jeb rolled over to Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:57.191
"I can help," said Jeb.

9
00:00:57.192 --> 00:01:00.244
Mr. Grill smiled.

10
00:01:00.245 --> 00:01:03.457
"Yes, Jeb!" he said.

11
00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:11.589
"You have a scooper!"

12
00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:16.105
Jeb picked up some snow.

13
00:01:16.106 --> 00:01:25.343
He moved it away.

14
00:01:25.344 --> 00:01:28.725
Jeb scooped up more snow.

15
00:01:28.726 --> 00:01:34.891
Soon the snow piles were gone.

16
00:01:34.892 --> 00:01:38.439
"Way to go, Jeb!" said Eddy.

17
00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:43.457
"We can get to the road now!"

18
00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:47.673
A big snowplow truck drove by.

19
00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:54.576
He was clearing the road.

20
00:01:54.577 --> 00:01:58.413
He looked at Jeb and nodded.

21
00:01:58.414 --> 00:02:04.974
"Good job, kid," said the truck.

22
00:02:04.975 --> 00:02:12.304
Jeb grinned.
